    <briefdescription>
<para>Symbol resolution interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Allows symbol flags and addresses to be looked up by name. Symbol queries are done in bulk (i.e. you request resolution of a set of symbols, rather than a single one) to reduce IPC overhead in the case of remote JITing, and expose opportunities for parallel compilation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
